---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Panel from "../components/Panel.astro";
import { site } from "../site.js";

const stores = [
	{ logo: "towercondos", name: "Tower Condos", text: "Rent a condo and make it yours." },
	{ logo: "sweetsuite", name: "Sweet Suite Furnishings", text: "Furniture for every room of your condo." },
	{ logo: "towercasino", name: "Tower Casino", text: "Slots, poker, duels and prize wheels." },
	{ logo: "toweroutfitters", name: "Tower Outfitters", text: "Player models, hats and accessories." },
	{ logo: "centralcircuit", name: "Central Circuit", text: "Electronics and appliances." },
	{ logo: "songbirds", name: "Songbirds", text: "Instruments and everything musical." },
	{ logo: "thetoystop2", name: "The Toy Stop", text: "Toys, games and silly gadgets." },
	{ logo: "basical", name: "Basical's Goods", text: "Everyday odds and ends." },
	{ logo: "smoothiebar", name: "Smoothie Bar", text: "Grab a drink by the pool." },
];
---
<Base title="About" description="What Skyline Tower is, the stores and places around the tower, and where it came from.">
	<h1 class="page-heading">About Skyline Tower</h1>

	<Panel title="What is this place?">
		<p><b>Skyline Tower</b> is a community-run revival of <b>GMod Tower</b>, the social hub for Garry's Mod where you hang out with friends, decorate your own condo, earn GMC, and hop into minigames without ever leaving the tower.</p>
		<p>Everything starts in the Lobby. Spend your GMC at the stores, watch videos with friends at the theater, gamble at the casino, dance at the nightclub, or relax at the pool and beach. Every so often a lobby event kicks off, and when you're ready for something bigger, step into a game portal and play one of our <a href="/gamemodes">gamemodes</a>.</p>
	</Panel>

	<Panel title="Around the Tower">
		<div class="store-grid">
			{stores.map((s) => (
				<div class="store">
					<span class="store-logo"><img src={`/img/gmt/stores/${s.logo}.png`} alt={s.name} loading="lazy" /></span>
					<span>{s.text}</span>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>
	</Panel>

	<Panel title="GMC">
		<p>GMC is the tower's currency. Earn it by playing gamemodes, winning events and unlocking achievements, then spend it on furniture, hats, pets, particles and more.</p>
	</Panel>

	<Panel title="Our Goal">
		<p>GMod Tower meant a lot to a lot of people. We want to keep that experience alive, fix what's broken, and build it back up with the community.</p>
		<p>The original GMod Tower and all of its artwork were created by <a href="https://www.pixeltailgames.com/">PixelTail Games</a>, who went on to make <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/394690/Tower_Unite/">Tower Unite</a>. Go check it out.</p>
		<p>Found a bug, have an idea, or want to help test? Come talk to us on <a href={site.links.discord}>Discord</a>.</p>
	</Panel>
</Base>
